{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transactions","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Array of ","type":"text"},{"code":"SKPaymentTransaction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" objects from StoreKit."}]}],"name":"transactions"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Automatically tracks in-app purchases from StoreKit transactions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"This enables:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Revenue tracking","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Monitor purchase revenue in Pushwoosh dashboard","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Purchase-based segmentation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Target paying users, high-value customers"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"LTV analysis"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Calculate customer lifetime value"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purchase events"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Trigger automations based on purchases","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKPaymentTransactionObserver"},{"text":" for all","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completed transactions."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate with StoreKit payment observer:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class StoreKitManager: NSObject, SKPaymentTransactionObserver {","","    func paymentQueue(_ queue: SKPaymentQueue,","                     updatedTransactions transactions: [SKPaymentTransaction]) {","","        let completedTransactions = transactions.filter {","            $0.transactionState == .purchased || $0.transactionState == .restored","        }","","        \/\/ Send completed transactions to Pushwoosh","        if !completedTransactions.isEmpty {","            Pushwoosh.configure.sendSKPaymentTransactions(completedTransactions)","        }","","        \/\/ Process each transaction","        for transaction in transactions {","            switch transaction.transactionState {","            case .purchased:","                handlePurchase(transaction)","                queue.finishTransaction(transaction)","","            case .restored:","                handleRestore(transaction)","                queue.finishTransaction(transaction)","","            case .failed:","                handleFailure(transaction)","                queue.finishTransaction(transaction)","","            case .deferred, .purchasing:","                break","","            @unknown default:","                break","            }","        }","    }","","    private func handlePurchase(_ transaction: SKPaymentTransaction) {","        let productId = transaction.payment.productIdentifier","","        \/\/ Update user tags for purchase segmentation","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"has_purchased\": true,","            \"last_purchase_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","            \"last_purchased_product\": productId","        ])","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendSKPaymentTransactions:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendSKPaymentTransactions:","symbolKind":"method","title":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sends StoreKit payment transactions to Pushwoosh for purchase tracking."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendskpaymenttransactions:"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","title":"PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/sendSKPaymentTransactions:":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendSKPaymentTransactions:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sends StoreKit payment transactions to Pushwoosh for purchase tracking."}],"title":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendSKPaymentTransactions:","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendskpaymenttransactions:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}